{
    "title": "ODEParameterEstimation.jl",
    "description": "<p>ODEParameterEstimation.jl is a Julia package that fits the parameters and initial conditions of an ordinary differential equation model to time-series data. It solves polynomial equations built from the model and from derivatives of the data, so it needs no starting guesses, returns every parameter set that fits when there is more than one, and reports which parameters the data cannot determine.</p>",
